## 3. Design decisions

### 3.1 The Run is the partition key
Not robot/time — `run_uuid` is Orbit's organizing unit. Bronze tables partition by
`dt` (run start date) for query pruning, but every row carries `run_uuid`, plus
`robot`, `mission_name`, and `site_walk_uuid` as columns. The dominant query
patterns are "everything from run X" and "all runs of mission Y on robot Z this
month".

